game is paused.

{{#if (eq engine.slug "none")}}
### `resume()`
{{else if (eq engine.slug "simple-2d")}}
### `resume(state)`
{{else}}
### `resume()`
{{/if}}

Poses the choice of `RESUME` from the pause menu: the screen returns to
`playing` and the board, the chain, and every timer carry on from exactly where
